<title>USA: Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Dean Witter Discover &amp; Co Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.68		    $0.51</p>
<p> Net			227,800		  178,100</p>
<p> Revs		   1,614,900		1,432,200</p>
<p>		   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$2.77		    $2.44</p>
<p> Net			951,400		  856,400</p>
<p> Revs		   6,230,100		5,675,900</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share reflect 2 for 1 stock split.</p>
<p>Revs are total net operating revenues, which are total revenues minus interest expense and the provision for losses on receivables.  </p>
<p>The securities business had Q4 earnings of $126.0 million, up 9 pct vs $115.8 million.</p>
<p>Credit Services earnings rose 63 percent to $101.8 million from $62.3 million in the fourth quarter a year ago.</p>
</text>
